  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0 - Adds a net10.0 target and drops net9.0 (end of support; a net9 consumer\nresolves the net8.0 assets). Requires CodexMicroORM.Core 1.4.1, which fixes a\npermanent ServiceScope leak - see that package's notes.\n\nNo API change. AssemblyVersion deliberately stays 1.2.0.0 so existing binding is\nunaffected on the net462 target.",
